{"slug":"s-t-r","ar":"س ت ر","total":3,"core":"covering; concealment","forms":[{"ar":"مَّسْتُور","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"hidden, concealing","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":45,"p":12,"ar":["وَإِذَا","قَرَأْتَ","ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","جَعَلْنَا","بَيْنَكَ","وَبَيْنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","حِجَابًا","مَّسْتُورًا"],"en":"And when you recite the Qur'an, We put between you and those who do not believe in the Hereafter a concealed partition"}},{"ar":"سِتْر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"shelter, cover","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":90,"p":15,"ar":["حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","بَلَغَ","مَطْلِعَ","ٱلشَّمْسِ","وَجَدَهَا","تَطْلُعُ","عَلَىٰ","قَوْمٍ","لَّمْ","نَجْعَل","لَّهُم","مِّن","دُونِهَا","سِتْرًا"],"en":"Until, when he came to the rising of the sun, he found it rising on a people for whom We had not made against it any shield"}},{"ar":"تَسْتَتِرُ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":1,"gloss":"to cover oneself, hide","word":null,"ex":{"s":41,"a":22,"p":3,"ar":["وَمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَسْتَتِرُونَ","أَن","يَشْهَدَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","سَمْعُكُمْ","وَلَآ","أَبْصَـٰرُكُمْ","وَلَا","جُلُودُكُمْ","وَلَـٰكِن","ظَنَنتُمْ","أَنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يَعْلَمُ","كَثِيرًا","مِّمَّا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"en":"And you were not covering yourselves, lest your hearing testify against you or your sight or your skins, but you assumed that Allah does not know much of what you do"}}],"surahs":[[17,1],[18,1],[41,1]]}